.SS [imu]
IMU driver settings.
.B [restart]
.\" BEGIN GENERATED: config-keys imu
.TP
.B driver
.RI (string,\ default:\ \(dqism330dhcx\(dq)
Driver name:
.BR ism330dhcx ,
.BR icm20948 ,
.BR icm42688p ,
.BR lsm6dso ,
.BR lsm6dsox ,
.BR mpu9250 ,
.BR mpu9255 ,
or
.B sim
