Calibration data written by
.BR imud-cal (8).
.TP
.I /var/lib/imud/
Black-box capture files ([capture] enabled).
.TP
.I /usr/share/imud/WMM.COF
World Magnetic Model 2025 coefficients (imud-wmm-data package).
.TP
.I /etc/imud/WMM.COF
Operator override; preferred over the packaged data when present.
